  "worked_solution": "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}\u27e8\\frac{{csc}^{2}\u2061t}{1-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061t},\\,2\\operatorname{cos}\u2061t\u27e9\\,\\text{d}t & =\u27e8{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}\\frac{{csc}^{2}\u2061t}{1-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061t}\\,\\text{d}t,{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}2\\operatorname{cos}\u2061t\\,\\text{d}t\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8\\operatorname{ln}\u2061(1-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061t){|}_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4},\\,2\\operatorname{sin}\u2061t{|}_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8\\operatorname{ln}\u2061(1-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061(\\frac{3\\pi }{4}))-\\operatorname{ln}\u2061(1-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061(\\frac{\\pi }{2})),\\,2\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(\\frac{3\\pi }{4})-2\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(\\frac{\\pi }{2})\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8\\operatorname{ln}\u20612-\\operatorname{ln}\u20611,\\,\\sqrt{2}-2\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8\\operatorname{ln}\u20612,\\,\\sqrt{2}-2\u27e9\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
